  <Title>k__BackingField: Welcome to Warehouse Safety Training
  <Description>k__BackingField: Before you can work on the warehouse floor, you must
    complete this safety module. Warehouses are active industrial environments with
    moving vehicles, heavy loads, and potential hazards at every turn. This training
    exists because the most common causes of warehouse injuries, slips, falling objects,
    and collisions are almost entirely preventable. Let us begin.
